00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:30.895
- And, you know, just, you know,
just watching his game

00:04:30.895 --> 00:04:33.314
there's really not a lot
of weaknesses, plain and simple.

00:04:33.314 --> 00:04:35.108
- Yeah.

00:04:35.108 --> 00:04:38.528
- I love the fact that we got to
