- Right, right.

00:06:13.915 --> 00:06:15.500
- So I'm thinking,
"OK, you  know

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.043
I got two guys
I can learn from."

00:06:17.043 --> 00:06:19.712
First of all,
before he even got there

00:06:19.712 --> 00:06:21.839
I'm worried if I'm gonna start.

00:06:21.839 --> 00:06:23.591
But everybody made it clear

00:06:23.591 --> 00:06:25.218
"Yeah, you're gonna start.
Of course you're gonna start."

00:06:25.218 --> 00:06:26.677
- Of course you're gonna start.
- But I'm thinking, like

00:06:26.677 --> 00:06:28.262
"These are two dudes
I look up to.

00:06:28.262 --> 00:06:31.224
How do I start over them,
both of them?"

00:06:31.224 --> 00:06:32.850
