- In their prime, I'd have loved

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:35.520
to have seen them race—
all three of you, really.

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:38.106
That would've been a tight one.
- Ooh! I don't know.

00:06:38.106 --> 00:06:39.899
- Yeah.
