- Yeah.

00:06:53.996 --> 00:06:56.249
You'll give him that.
- So then what about you and Deion?

00:06:56.249 --> 00:06:57.583
- You know,
maybe we're neck and neck.

00:06:57.583 --> 00:06:59.544
You know,
I can't give him anything.

00:06:59.544 --> 00:07:01.170
- I was gonna say, don't give it to him.
- Not on tape, not on tape.
- Don't give it to him.

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:03.131
- I was gonna say, don't give it to him.
- Not on tape, not on tape.
- Don't give it to him.

